A layout TextureName that is a WAD path hash (fmt::wad_link_key, "#<hash>")
and no .ltk atlas has: the file whose path has that xxh64, from the named
WADs (UI, Global, Common, Map11, Map12, DATA), loaded as its own texture.
The HUD's panels (player frame, ability bar, shop) are such files in the
newer data: drawn as nothing before. The first misses go to stderr.

